---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { andrea, cedarRidge } from '../../lib/golf';
---
<Layout title="Connected Golf Network — StickLink Golf" description="See how golfers, courses, events, and physical golf touchpoints can share one connected interaction layer." eyebrow="STICKLINK GOLF NETWORK / MICHIGAN">
  <section class="page shell"><div class="eyebrow">ONE IDENTITY ACROSS THE GAME</div><h1>Golf Network.</h1><p class="page-lead">The golfer, the course, and the event can finally share a physical layer without needing to become the same organization.</p><div class="network-grid"><div class="network-card golfer-node"><span class="node-label">GOLFER IDENTITY</span><h2>{andrea.name}</h2><b>{andrea.id.toUpperCase()}</b><div class="network-stats"><span><strong>{andrea.coursesPlayed}</strong>courses</span><span><strong>{andrea.rounds}</strong>rounds</span><span><strong>{andrea.achievements}</strong>badges</span></div><a class="button secondary" href="/passport/">View passport ↗</a></div><div class="network-connector"><span>PHYSICAL GRAPH</span><i>↕</i><small>identity · trust · interaction<br />commerce · provenance</small></div><div class="network-card course-node"><span class="node-label">COURSE IDENTITY</span><h2>{cedarRidge.name}</h2><p>{cedarRidge.address}</p><div class="network-stats"><span><strong>18</strong>holes</span><span><strong>{cedarRidge.tapPoints}</strong>points</span><span><strong>04</strong>events</span></div><a class="button secondary" href="/course/cedar-ridge/">Open course ↗</a></div></div><div class="network-layers"><article><span>01</span><h3>Golfers</h3><p>Passport, achievements, equipment, memberships, official integrations.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h3>Courses</h3><p>Holes, tee sets, commerce, sponsors, StickLinks, and collectibles.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h3>Events</h3><p>Tournaments, leagues, teams, challenges, results, and provenance.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h3>Physical graph</h3><p>The shared layer that makes each interaction addressable and meaningful.</p></article></div></section>
</Layout>
